# ========================================================
# Kunal Khuteta Portfolio — Environment Variables
# ========================================================

# --------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION 1 (RECOMMENDED): Resend API
# Free tier: 3,000 emails/month, zero setup.
# 1. Sign up at https://resend.com
# 2. Generate an API Key under "API Keys"
# 3. Paste it here:
# --------------------------------------------------------
RESEND_API_KEY=
RESEND_FROM_EMAIL=Kunal Khuteta <onboarding@resend.dev>

# --------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION 2: Gmail SMTP via Nodemailer
# Directly dispatch from your personal or business Gmail:
# 1. Go to your Google Account -> Security -> 2-Step Verification -> App Passwords
# 2. Create an App Password for "Mail" / "Portfolio"
# 3. Enter your Gmail and the 16-character App Password below:
# --------------------------------------------------------
GMAIL_USER=
GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=

# --------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION 3: Custom SMTP (SendGrid, Postmark, AWS SES, Brevo)
# --------------------------------------------------------
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.example.com
# SMTP_PORT=587
# SMTP_USER=
# SMTP_PASS=
# SMTP_SECURE=false

# --------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION 4: WhatsApp Gateway (Staged for Meta / Twilio)
# When you want to activate live WhatsApp messaging:
# --------------------------------------------------------
# TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID=
# TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN=
# TWILIO_WHATSAPP_NUMBER=whatsapp:+14155238886
# META_WHATSAPP_TOKEN=
# META_WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID=
